Chronology uses the accepted complete synthetic plan, real Store and real
OriginAccounting with a deterministic synthetic clock. Scientific stages are
explicit routing seams, never numeric evidence. Terminal tests use the real
runtime/Store with synthetic preflight, admission and evaluator outcomes.
All test substitutions target this new controller module only.
"""
